                "name": "\"High Spirit\"",
                "type": "Mindscape 1",
                "desc": "The maximum stack limit of Electro Prison from Basic Attack: Ha-Oto no Ya increases to 14 stacks. When an Electro Quiver is triggered, 2 consecutive Ha-Oto no Ya will be fired at the target."
