                    "text": "When Zhu Yuan is under Suppressive Mode, using Enhanced Shotshells increases her DMG by 23.3%. When attacking Stunned enemies, this DMG buff is increased by an additional 23.3%. When Zhu Yuan enters the battlefield, she immediately gains 6 Enhanced Shotshells."
